==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|XY|Bidoof|106}} from the {{TCG|XY}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Bidoof}}.
*{{m|Super Fang}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Bidoof}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Brilliant Diamond}}.

